PROCEDURE:
    1. Open cisco packet tracer application
    2. Pick and place all required devices
    3. Assign IP address and connect devices
    4. Type the commands in CLI
    5. Ping and watch the output

COMMANDS:
Router>CLI
    • enable
    • configure terminal
    • hostname R1
    • ip domain-name example.com
    • crypto key generate rsa
    • 1024
    • ip ssh version 2
    • username admin privilege 15 secret cisco123
    • interface fastEthernet0/0
    • ip address 192.168.1.1 255.255.255.0
    • no shutdown
    • exit
    • line vty 0 4
    • login local
    • transport input ssh
    • exit
    • end
    • write memory
